      "id": "pt-artigos",
      "level": "A1",
      "title": "Artigos",
      "en": "Definite and indefinite articles",
      "note": "Articles agree with the noun: o livro, a casa, os livros, as casas. Indefinite articles are um, uma, uns and umas. In European Portuguese an article is usual before a possessive (o meu livro) and often before a personal name (a Maria). Learn each noun together with its article.",
