      "id": "pt-demonstrativos",
      "level": "A1",
      "title": "Demonstrativos",
      "en": "This, that and agreement",
      "note": "Este/esta/estes/estas point to something near the speaker; esse/essa/esses/essas often relate to the listener or something already mentioned; aquele/aquela/aqueles/aquelas point farther away. Each agrees with its noun. Isto, isso and aquilo stand alone and do not vary. In these exercises choose the form that agrees with the noun; the English translation supplies the intended distance.",
