      "id": "pt-possessivos",
      "level": "A2",
      "title": "Possessivos",
      "en": "Possessives and agreement",
      "note": "Possessives agree with what is owned, not with the owner: o meu livro, a minha casa, os meus livros, as minhas casas. The same pattern gives teu/tua, seu/sua and nosso/nossa. European Portuguese usually includes the definite article. Seu can mean his, her, their or formal your; dele/dela can clarify the owner. The exercises use agreement to distinguish the forms.",
