    {
      "id": "pt-perfeito",
      "level": "A2",
      "title": "Pretérito perfeito",
      "en": "Completed actions in the past",
      "note": "The simple pretérito perfeito presents a completed action: Ontem falei com a Ana. Regular -ar endings are -ei, -aste, -ou, -ámos, -astes, -aram; -er uses -i, -este, -eu, -emos, -estes, -eram; -ir uses -i, -iste, -iu, -imos, -istes, -iram. European Portuguese distinguishes present falamos from past falámos. Common irregulars include fui, tive, fiz and disse.",
      "verbs": {
        "rows": [
          [
            "perfeito",
            "Pretérito perfeito",
            "IND;PST;PFV"
          ]
        ],
        "max": 400,
        "notAlso": [
          "IND;PRS"
        ]
      },
      "table": {
