      "id": "pt-contracoes",
      "level": "A2",
      "title": "Contrações",
      "en": "Prepositions joined to articles",
      "note": "De, em, a and por combine with definite articles: de + o = do; em + a = na; a + a = à; por + os = pelos. The contraction agrees with the following noun. These combinations are written as one word; à and às have a grave accent. Compare Vou à escola with Estou na escola.",
